        "title": "A Touching Place",
        "text": "Together with our excllent guide, Mr Kumoda, arranged by Good Karma trekkinng, we spent 3 hours at this most sacred of nepali Hindu sights.  We respectfully viewed a cremation from a distance and witnessed part of the preparation of the body for the cremation.  Not being Hindu, we could not enter the shrine but that did not take that much away from the experience provided by our excellent guide.  \nThe Bagmati river is just filthy with trash but the visit was impressive.\nTake the time to visit this site in detail.",
